BranchTraits: {
	Artilleryman: Artilleryman: Fires in a distinctive mortar arc; shells deal increased explosion damage while descending
	Musha: Musha: Attacks restore life, but holding this weapon disables healing potions
	Dreadnought: Dreadnought: Hold attack to charge; a full charge deals massive single-hit damage
	ArtsFighter: Arts Fighter: Attacks ignore enemy defense
	MechAccord: Mech-Accord Caster: Only enemies close enough to the cursor can be selected
	Mystic: Mystic: Store additional projectiles while not attacking and release them together
	Phalanx: Phalanx Caster: Gain higher defense while not attacking; attacking temporarily disables the energy shield
	Spreadshooter: Spreadshooter: Fires many projectiles in a spread
	Executor: Executor: Moving quickly, dashing, landing, or respawning counts as triggering a skill
	Centurion: Centurion: Attacks all nearby enemies at an extremely high frequency
	Medic: Medic: Attacking allied players heals them
	ChainCaster: Chain Caster: Lightning can bounce between multiple enemies
	SplashCaster: Splash Caster: Attacks deal sustained damage over time
	Deadeye: Deadeye: Hold the attack button to charge; a full charge fires a powerful shell
	Crossbowman: Crossbowman: Rapidly fires arrows
}
